  - eldercare
  - privacy-preserving
abstract: >-
  A privacy-first fall detector for senior-care rooms on a Jetson Orin Nano: a floor-level 2D LIDAR finds a
  person lying down from geometry alone, with no images; two webcams with an on-device RF-DETR detector were
  evaluated offline for the poses a single scan plane misses, and a fine-tuned RF-DETR class split passed its
  pre-declared bars on public data and, from the counter camera only, on recorded room frames (the floor camera
  failed the head-first pose). The repository holds the ROS 2 detector, an offline
  replay harness, pre-declared evaluations with their results (including the ones that failed), and eighteen
  decision records. Research prototype measured on one subject in one room; not a medical device. Patent pending.
